Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The End Narancia. When you get a sec,\Nlet me see that key I risked my life for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't throw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaargh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.51,0:00:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.43,0:00:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You are such a drama queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy my hand had feeling at\Nall given what you just went through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.78,0:00:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The damn thing has only been\Nreattached for 30 minutes, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So happy or not, it still hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But enough about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You safeguarded my daughter's life,\Nand therefore you have my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to Napoli, Cinderella,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Benario 6, look for the turtle at\Nthe water fountain, and use this key.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.98,0:00:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You are to take her to Venice by train.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Postscript says, directives will\Ncease once we have arrived in Venice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.96,0:00:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are we supposed\Nto find at this water fountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.04,0:00:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know, but the boss said there was\Na way to travel under the enemy's radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.96,0:01:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be risky, but we have to trust him\Nspeaking of the boss. Do you think he's?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe already there I mean it kind of\Nsounds like it that doesn't concern us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.22,0:01:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Our focus is on finishing\Nthe mission there's a train
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.62,0:01:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,bound for France in ten minutes\Nthat we don't want to miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.66,0:01:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista we alone looks like\Nwe're in the clear for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.48,0:01:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we get to the\Nstation though I bet the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,place will be swarming\Nwith rats ready to snitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.30,0:01:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine what you must be going\Nthrough suddenly having a target.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.44,0:01:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,on your back because of an estranged\Nfather it must be terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.16,0:01:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I feel you. Fugo, I've\Nbeen preoccupied by our
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.88,0:01:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,lively new friends too\Nif you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.96,0:01:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No that's not what I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.68,0:01:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, miss, you gotta forget Fugo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.64,0:01:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't mean to come off\Nas an over-eager horndog!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.12,0:01:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it seems like we hit\Nthe brakes so my man here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.52,0:02:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Could peek at those jaunty jiggle sacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.28,0:02:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but I give you my word that's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.50,0:02:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Blame his weakness in the face of Fugo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.20,0:02:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shut up, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.11,0:02:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I was bracing for impact,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're making it sound like\NI was trying to cop a veal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just promise me whatever you\Ndo, you won't tell the boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.40,0:04:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.02,0:04:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.64,0:04:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.42,0:04:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The dumbass actually showed up\Nto the station in broad daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll regret that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the pressure he's under has\Nmade logic give way to desperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps the Stronzo thinks he's figured\Nout a way to throw us off the trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.44,0:04:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll still butcher him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.02,0:04:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He killed Illuso and Formaggio!\NHe's dead! Hey, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.74,0:04:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool it with this stupid\Nbutcher crap, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.42,0:04:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's annoying as all hell. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.12,0:04:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Our squadra of mafiosi has\Nno need for talk like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave that drivel to the weaklings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.94,0:04:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Our group has a peculiar way about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.30,0:04:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,By the time primitive thoughts\Nlike that enter our minds,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.58,0:04:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the enemy's already been butchered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.78,0:04:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to\Nannounce the inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.14,0:04:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Such words have never crossed my lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.58,0:04:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Pesci, you need to follow my example.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:05:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Prove that you're one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.64,0:05:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.32,0:05:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, do ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.72,0:05:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it, big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.76,0:05:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Say butchered from now on\Nlike the job's a done deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.90,0:05:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Prosciutto
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.94,0:05:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.85,0:05:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll head over on the\Nplatform here. Pesci you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,get on and head to the\Nfront car from the inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.20,0:05:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,On it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll corner him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We need the boss's daughter alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.18,0:05:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati it's getting close to\Ndeparture time something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.22,0:05:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only water fountain\Nhere I'm sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.56,0:05:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no way this was\Ndesigned for this keyhole.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.02,0:05:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even need a key to open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.10,0:05:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing more than an access hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:05:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, what about the\Nlock on that fire hydrant?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.16,0:06:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This lock isn't a match either. Merda!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How can this be the right place\Nif the key won't fit anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.26,0:06:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is maddening!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.24,0:06:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we pass on this train?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The train in 15 minutes is bound for Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.54,0:06:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.45,0:06:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy probably knows we're\Nhere and are headed to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.56,0:06:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't stay longer than we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Benario 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.16,0:06:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The turtle by the fountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If this isn't the spot, then where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.08,0:06:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.14,0:06:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:06:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain, Pesci.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.72,0:06:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing here? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.16,0:07:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, big bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.04,0:07:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Bucciarati run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.46,0:07:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I saw him climb aboard\Nthe train right before I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no way in hell you didn't pass\Nby him as he was walking down the aisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm right, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.56,0:07:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta believe me,\NI didn't see nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Bucciarati, his annoying friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,that new guy, not even the\Nboss's twerp, none of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This little disappearing\Nact doesn't sit right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The train's about to take off, big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.04,0:07:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got to be sneaking\Naround the station somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.40,0:07:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They just gotta be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't know who's after them,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.50,0:07:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so they're waiting to spot us\Nbefore hopping on a getaway train.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.20,0:07:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm positive I'm not imagining things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.98,0:07:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There was something by\Nthat water fountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have picked it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:07:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He grabbed something dark by the\Nfountain before jumping on the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Pesci, get on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.64,0:08:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But why? Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.06,0:08:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how they're doing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but I have a hunch that Bucciarati and his
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.26,0:08:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,little yes-men are\Nhiding out on this train.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.16,0:08:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're basing all that on a hunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss must be offering those\Nclots some kind of assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to move quickly now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My hunch says this is the last chance\Nwe're gonna have before we lose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.66,0:08:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop gawking and get on the train!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.84,0:08:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A three-and-a-half-hour train\Nride separates Napoli from France.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But the midway point, Reimi, lies\Nbut a mere one-and-a-half hours away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.94,0:08:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, now we're stuck\Non the train. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.22,0:08:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Pesci, there's a space under the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.68,0:08:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Something must be back here. But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.54,0:08:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that room for the\Nguy who drives the train?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.42,0:08:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think seven\Npeople could hole up
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,in there without a single person noticing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.32,0:08:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.74,0:08:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't be too careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you unleash\NFisherman and find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.26,0:09:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.74,0:09:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fisherman!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.58,0:09:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not picking up on seven\Nassholes, but I do sense two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.92,0:09:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Merida, what a tight squeeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Only room for the engineer.\NNo matter I know those
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.22,0:09:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastards are somewhere on\Nthis train, huh? Hey, wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a second I only hooked one of\Nthem what Gibbs I could have sworn I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.94,0:09:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,heard two hearts thumping in there so\Nwhy'd my rod only managed to hook the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.14,0:09:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,NG guy hey Pesci get off your ass\Nwe're searching the train from top to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.92,0:10:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,bottom we'll find him and rip those\Ncowards out from their hiding spot but!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're staying put.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.94,0:10:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If Bucciarati's goons figure\Nout that we're here too,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.70,0:10:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you can bet they'll come\Nrushing in to stop the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.32,0:10:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you covered, big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.20,0:10:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't forget about their cargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.28,0:10:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as the girl's with them, they\Ncan't tear through the train on a whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.18,0:10:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They have to play it safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.04,0:10:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is what gives us the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.54,0:10:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll snatch the girl and off those\Nclowns before we reach Reimi Termini!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.60,0:10:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The key wasn't made to\Nfit in a keyhole but
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,it fit perfectly in the\Nshell of this turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.22,0:10:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow that activated\Nthe turtle's special
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.90,0:10:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,ability the key seems\Nto function as a portal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.84,0:10:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,To an alternate space\None where we can remain
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,sight unseen so the\Nturtle is a stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.64,0:10:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Under a seat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.02,0:10:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is the bomb diggity!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.84,0:11:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This turtle's like a loungy spaceship!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, I thought this room\Nwas some sort of illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.62,0:11:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's a bonafide structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.74,0:11:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And all the furniture is real, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.16,0:11:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the drinks are cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the boss is responsible\Nfor these accommodations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.00,0:11:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For the most part, turtles will\Nremain quiet and still in dark spaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, we should be able\Nto travel to Venice without issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.10,0:11:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.01,0:11:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess hiding in here\Nwould be pretty dumb, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.00,0:11:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish my gut talked to me\Nthe way that my big bros does.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.44,0:11:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Big Bro making this haze?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.26,0:11:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The thankful death!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.80,0:11:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro, you're really doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:12:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're going to do\Nit to everybody on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.22,0:12:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't even know if\Nthey're on this train.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.36,0:12:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we figure that\Nout before we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.10,0:12:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, we're going\Nto be thorough about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here all right, I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.42,0:12:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, you're making\Na fuss over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.14,0:12:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Planes from all over fall from the sky\Nevery year and the world keeps spinning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.54,0:12:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,These jumps are getting off easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.74,0:12:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's being stuck inside a\Nturtle has its drawbacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of muggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.80,0:12:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Narancia, you want a drink too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:12:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you're good with it being cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.80,0:13:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's cola.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.26,0:13:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and mineral water, sparkling water,\Nand apple, orange, and pineapple juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening to me at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.30,0:13:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.24,0:13:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You say something, Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked if you wanted something to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.28,0:13:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Though you might want to\Ntry getting some shut-eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.84,0:13:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You've seen better days there, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.64,0:13:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep an eye on the\Nceiling while you rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.22,0:13:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm actually starting to\Nfeel a little achy anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My back and shoulders are killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll cop a squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.60,0:13:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Something warm would sure\Nhit the spot right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.64,0:13:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But nothing too heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,For the last time, all we've\Ngot in the fridge are cold ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, is your brain shut\Ndown when you talk to people?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.70,0:13:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, banana it is. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.70,0:13:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, gardens like these\Nreally soothe the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stress just melts away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.98,0:13:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so heavenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.26,0:13:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, oh man,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.40,0:13:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,what I'd give to bask in\Nthat Garden of Eden's warm
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.92,0:14:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,sunshine just daydreaming\Nabout the good old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.94,0:14:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Rose, would you cut that shit out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.26,0:14:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody wants your nasty-ass\Nspit on the damn pages!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.46,0:14:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.37,0:14:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying I did what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.48,0:14:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way! You're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're, uh, drooling\Npretty bad there, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.52,0:14:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That is so freaking nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.34,0:14:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The heck is that? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.44,0:14:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I was craving this\Nbanana, but it's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, just look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.66,0:14:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a piece of old stale\Nbeef jerky. That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.74,0:14:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You really had me going there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Good on you, Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.00,0:14:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't scare me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.36,0:14:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It almost looks like that thing coming\Nout of your mouth is a real tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:15:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate the commitment, but I\Nthink you're taking the bit too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.06,0:15:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what is that dangling thing made of?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.12,0:15:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You say something again, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.12,0:15:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak louder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.32,0:15:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop whispering, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hear what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.04,0:15:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,These ears don't seem to be\Nworking as well as they used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.94,0:15:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and would you just\Nlook at this banana?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.40,0:15:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.68,0:15:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't eat something\Nlike that! How gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.62,0:15:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.62,0:15:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's old and rotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.32,0:15:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This darn fruit's foul!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.25,0:15:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.17,0:15:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.08,0:15:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The fruit's gone bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.99,0:15:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you look like a freaking grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.42,0:15:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then, I suppose I'll lead\Nmy example and speak up first!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.84,0:15:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.64,0:15:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't eat this thing if\Nyou stuffed it down my throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.46,0:15:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.40,0:15:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I try to\Ntouch it, it falls apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,See, it's way past its prime.\NBucciarati! Yes, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.74,0:15:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A stand did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.30,0:16:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,One of our enemies must be\Nsomewhere aboard this train.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.96,0:16:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with all this gray stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.62,0:16:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, did this tuft of\Nhair come out of my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.86,0:16:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.30,0:16:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.90,0:16:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.86,0:16:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are we fighting now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.40,0:16:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all geriatrics!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.54,0:16:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up! Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.48,0:16:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.76,0:16:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.04,0:16:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.66,0:16:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this all fucked me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.48,0:16:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this stand makes people older.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:16:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they figure us out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.42,0:17:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the enemy find out\Nwe're hiding in this turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.48,0:17:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If they had any idea about\Nour reptilian bunker,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.32,0:17:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,they would have launched\Na more direct assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.74,0:17:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't know where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.70,0:17:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a desperate\Nattempt to root us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.74,0:17:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But one thing's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.36,0:17:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Our enemies definitely know we're\Nhiding somewhere on this train.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.70,0:17:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to track down Trish, they're\Nwilling to take out every passenger aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.70,0:17:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me this\Ntrain is careening down
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.64,0:17:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the tracks chock-full of\Nseniors on Death's door?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.62,0:17:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.53,0:17:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,They're desperate, so they'll\Ndo whatever it takes to beat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And they won't even bat an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.14,0:17:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We now only have two choices before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.08,0:17:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Choice one, we take Trish and\Nget the hell off this train.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.74,0:17:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Or we ignore the fact that we don't know\Nour attacker's range and hunt them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Number two it is if we want to escape with\NTrish then we have to stop this train.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.32,0:17:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Jumping now is a death\Nwish assassination is my
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.86,0:18:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,thing my six bullets will\Nfind the enemy and put him
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.98,0:18:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,six feet under that's right\Nyou're our ace sadly we're
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,out of time our bodies are\Naging at blinding speed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.30,0:18:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, my hands
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.40,0:18:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,look now my skin and nails are peeling off
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,they're disintegrating
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.26,0:18:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you're right Bucciarati if we\Ndon't act ASAP we're screwed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't be rash mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too early to abandon ship. What\Ncrazy bullshit are you going on about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.50,0:18:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.50,0:18:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.28,0:18:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, what we can't do is waste time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.96,0:18:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all ears, Jean. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.82,0:18:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think we're all aging\Nat different rates from Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.60,0:19:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The aging's hit me and Mista a lot less,\Nand Trisha's better off than us. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.30,0:19:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You can just chalk it up\Nto good genes or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.86,0:19:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out of here! Mista,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.06,0:19:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,why do you think our attackers are attacking\Neverything on the train that moves?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.24,0:19:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They have to know they\Ncould very easily end
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.52,0:19:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,up killing Trish in\Ntheir efforts to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.32,0:19:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The speed of the aging\Nhas to be conditional.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cut right to the chase here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.06,0:19:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I think our body heat is key.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.76,0:19:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They can discern men from women\Nby the differences in temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.68,0:19:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I once read that women have a\Nhigher body fat percentage than men.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.56,0:19:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So as a result, their body temperature\Ntends to be a bit more stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.56,0:19:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Moreover, women's cells tend\Nto age slower than men's,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.22,0:19:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,which is why they supposedly live longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.38,0:19:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say earlier that\Nit was getting warm in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.46,0:19:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They're observing the changes\Nin our body temperatures,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and they're using that to\Ncontrol the speed of our aging.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.62,0:19:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,All you have to remember is\Nthat men age faster than women.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.18,0:19:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a real nice theory\Nwhen you put it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.80,0:20:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But why am I fine while you're a geezer?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.68,0:20:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying I'm a chick or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.62,0:20:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Our body temperatures would\Nbe cooler than theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.46,0:20:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of us were sipping on cold drinks,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.82,0:20:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but Narancia wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.50,0:20:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.96,0:20:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, your theory was spot on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.48,0:20:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're aging at a slower rate than the rest\Nof you because our bodies were cooler!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.30,0:20:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to start cooling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.60,0:20:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now grab some ice and start\Nrubbing out those wrinkles!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.16,0:20:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.08,0:20:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to figure out a way\Nto take that ice with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.48,0:20:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.46,0:20:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, everything depends\Non destroying our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.84,0:20:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.75,0:20:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The ice will be imperative\Nin being able to defeat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.84,0:20:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to do the deed before your\Nstand in the ice disappear completely!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.34,0:20:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.88,0:21:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.28,0:21:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot as hell. They really are\Nattacking everything in sight. How awful
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.14,0:21:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder if the turtle's\Naging too but don't they
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.22,0:21:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,live for like a bajillion\Nyears or something
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.20,0:21:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess he'll outlive us\Nall what a drag you're
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.72,0:21:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna get me killed bro\Ni hope all this is worth
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.76,0:21:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is my reckless big bro gonna\Ndo if I start getting old, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.66,0:21:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now, if I can get the air running,\Nthat may just cool everyone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.04,0:21:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I might be able to\Nslow down that freaky aging.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.84,0:21:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.98,0:21:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like they took the bank!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.82,0:21:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd this frickin'\Nhook get under my skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.04,0:21:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be the guy that's\Ntrying to age us to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.90,0:22:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.32,0:22:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.56,0:22:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dealing with two users.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.72,0:22:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.56,0:22:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.38,0:23:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.20,0:23:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.92,0:23:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah. I do. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.42,0:23:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I do. I'm freaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.20,0:23:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
